  "ingredients": [
    "1 (16 ounce) can refrigerated jumbo buttermilk biscuits",
    "1 (9.6 ounce) package Jimmy Dean® Original Hearty Pork Sausage Crumbles",
    "0.25 cup flour",
    "2.5 cups milk",
    "salt and freshly ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UiEIBxeK9o6Ci3LiwUyaEfmCd-g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-216391-Easy-Sausage-Gravy-Biscuits-step-0-e15714266e394b04b942242eb1408b76.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216391/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Arrange biscuits 1 to 2 inches apart on an ungreased cookie sheet. Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, about 13 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CV_FKnXZplmIi5bluX3tKG4bwjg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-216391-Easy-Sausage-Gravy-Biscuits-step-1-71a92221abed4de387a4952cfbdce978.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216391/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, cook sausage in a large skillet over medium heat until thoroughly heated, stirring frequently, about 5 to 6 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oRQN7B6JY_YQPYjMguOTEvhgj78=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-216391-Easy-Sausage-Gravy-Biscuits-step-2-772ff054d2014a20bdbe5093bd53f4fb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216391/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in flour until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yB-skCnvln4v5xhrbj1hxTgZ3eg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-216391-Easy-Sausage-Gravy-Biscuits-step-3-3c33506fbea648d4867c743b1d73822f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216391/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gradually add milk, stirring continuously, until the gravy thickens and comes to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low; simmer and stir for 2 more minutes. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CcGgwtZSWcuT0nI2MceJv8IATjk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-216391-Easy-Sausage-Gravy-Biscuits-step-4-B-67123dd834494bfc88fb5888d906b497.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216391/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Split biscuits in half. Place 2 halves on each of 8 plates; top with about 1/3 cup gravy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nMNGkd-8kr1GVDI7rgLUFnsXb0s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-216391-Easy-Sausage-Gravy-Biscuits-hero-4x3-4ea5190f4be74199a4ba2fed3eff3a5b.jpg"
